  "title": "Pasta with Chicken and Sun-Dried Tomatoes in Gorgonzola Sauce",
  "description": "Store-bought rotisserie chicken is combined with a light Gorgonzola and wine sauce, tossed with farfalle pasta, and topped with Parmesan cheese for a quick and easy dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Brian Graves"
  ],
